{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BPROOF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BPROOF is a tactical survival game</strong>, where survival, quick decisions, and adaptation make the difference between life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wave Mode \u2013 The Basics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current <strong>Wave Mode</strong> lets players face successive waves of enemies, solo or in multiplayer. Each wave becomes stronger, faster, or more tactically challenging. Between waves, points can be used to acquire new weapons, heal, or gain strategic advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement, dodging, and precise aiming are crucial. The map space and chosen enemy types greatly influence gameplay. Wave Mode serves as an <strong>entry point</strong> to BPROOF, introducing core mechanics of combat, survival, and pressure situations.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Match ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/cd0444234e148ed573fab012a742fbe28800c263.jpg"},{"name":"Killed the First 50s","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/41256a1e0622c027159ffe65adc5ed9b2a676246.jpg"},{"name":"Killed the First 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/b0bb3b95651125f7d931659c0a59b6eeb90bad94.jpg"},{"name":"Killed the First 500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/65e7781312c92a98fc17c33dde666101edb671c0.jpg"},{"name":"Killed the First 1000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/d3f47ad3987b04b1338ff7d67ffcaf53f27d37d5.jpg"},{"name":"Weaponmen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/366bbe503ef3cd988bdc2e4e117d619a90e18603.jpg"},{"name":"Bulletproof","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/1